  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know just where to hit to knock your opponents senseless.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sap Adept<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use a bludgeoning weapon to successfully deal nonlethal sneak attack damage to an opponent, you may spent one point of mythic power to inflict a penalty to either their attack rolls or AC equal to the number of sneak attack dice rolled for one round. Mythic foes receive a Fortitude save (DC 10 + damage dealt + your mythic tier) to negate this effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc55\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
